{"id":"vod_md_5545","vodId":"5545","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"日常系的异能战斗","name_cn":"日常系的异能战斗","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231002-1/2248427861633d512a19db2b94bd7602.jpg"},"summary":"泉光高中文艺部生活着一群性格各异的青春男女，其中高中二年级的安藤寿来（冈本信彦 配音）是一个典型的中二病，他每天梦想拥有超能力来拯救世界，谁想到不切实际的愿望竟然真的实现了。在毫无征兆的日子里，安藤掌握了“黑焰”的能力，其他成员也各有所长，如操纵时间的隐藏宅女神崎灯代（ 山崎遥 配音）、掌握自然属性的天然少女栉川鸠子（早见沙织 配音）、可把一切事物还原的腐女部长高梨彩弓（种田梨沙 配音）、可自由创造物质和空间的文艺部顾问老师的侄女姬木千冬（山下七海 配音）。可是现实世界没有邪恶敌人对付怎么办？那就只好自娱自乐喽……本片根据望公太的轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-02 08:14:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/7W4Ztz90/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/MHX836Xh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/ARJvLAfA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/v7shbr7K/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/5IPFqfUV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/sKdLy1s2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/U6e0lMzW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/hHEOw5tJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/0sfIwlG6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/XxSRIp4S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/bVLCHPp1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/WxKmr9Ex/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:33.657Z"}